d. The \"rule card\" will incorporate \"if-then-else\" logic, making Mission 5's two-level branching intuitive.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"e:\\codekids\\src\\components\\mission\\BlockEditor.tsx","EndLine":100,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"Viewing BlockEditor lines 1-100","toolSummary":"View BlockEditor lines 1-100"}}]}
